      "cooked": "<p>HI there, i am new to Sentinels of the Multiverse, but am loving it so far..&nbsp;</p><p>I have one question about defating Omnitron, to defeat him, do we have to just destroy one side, or both sides. IE, do we need to deplete 100 hp from Rampaging Robot, and then 100 hp from Self Aware Robotics factory, or does this card mean that he has just 100 HP combined, not 100 HP each side of the card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p><p>Steve</p>",
