      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-24T22:58:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Omnitron has only 100 HP between both sides, once you've done 100 HP of damage to it, Omnitron is defeated, you don't need to keep track of both sides HP individually.</p><p>For comparison if you look at Baron Blade you can see he DOES have 2 seperate HP tracks... but he only flips once so tracking his HP is easy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Enjoy your battles to save the multiverse!</p>",
